<title>SWITZERLAND: Von Moos sees turnaround in 1999 at latest.</title>
<headline>Von Moos sees turnaround in 1999 at latest.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss steel group Von Moos said in a statement it expected to return to profit in 1999 at the latest and that a profit was possible in 1998 if market developments allowed.</p>
<p>&quot;If the market develops favourably a profit is possible even in 1998,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>In December Von Moos said it expected to post an ordinary loss of 54 million Swiss francs in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
